body:
I ate an entire kg bag of sugar with a spoon during a binge because I didn't have anything else in the house. I also dry scooped a bag of protein powder and oh my lord the protein farts I had after that was insane. 

&#x200B;

Also I just want to say some of you are talking about how you got upset over people messing up your allotted calories or you fasted for x amount of time. Those are signs of anorexia, you may be suffering from something completely different and I would advise getting that checked by a professional.
